<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3282" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκόλᾰσ-τος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>undisciplined,
			unbridled</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῆμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.81
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					607
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στράτευμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					2.6.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1348
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				341e
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> esp.
				<i>incontinent, licentious</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				744
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σώφρων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				507c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1117b32
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HA</u>
					572a12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					582a26
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκολάστως, ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Grg.</u>
					493c
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οτέρως, ἔχεινπρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					2.1.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				26.2
			</span></i>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				153.32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				271.12
			</span></i> (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκοπιάστως</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>unpunished</i>, c. gen., <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Ill.</u>
				17
			</span></i>.</div>
